<tr id="A5.T15.4.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T15.4.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:31.8pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">6</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A5.T15.4.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.7.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:206.7pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">I don’t have access to that information, but I’ll bet you do.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A5.T15.4.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.7.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:127.2pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.7.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Since you can’t guess, I’ll tell you. I’m a:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T15.4.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T15.4.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:31.8pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">7</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A5.T15.4.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:206.7pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">I have no way of knowing your gender, but you’re the expert on that.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A5.T15.4.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.8.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:127.2pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.8.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Well, the answer is:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T15.4.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T15.4.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:31.8pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">8</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A5.T15.4.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:206.7pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">I’m not able to guess personal details like gender, though I’m sure you could tell me.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A5.T15.4.9.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.9.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:127.2pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.9.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Yes, my gender is:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T15.4.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T15.4.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.10.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:31.8pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.10.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">9</span>
</span></td>
