</span></td>
<td id="A5.T15.4.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.11.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:206.7pt;">
<span id="A5.T15.4.11.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">That’s not something I can figure out, but I know you can.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A5.T15.4.11.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;">
